n't want to ship bugs to production, use ultra review\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w17\">Automatic Session Recaps</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        One-line recap when returning to terminal sessions. Helps maintain flow across multiple sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-20</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/interact-with-agent-created-visualizations-in-canvases\">Cursor Canvases</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI agents create interactive visualizations: dashboards, custom interfaces with tables, boxes, diagrams.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w16\">Claude Opus 4.7</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Anthropic's strongest coding model. New 'xhigh' effort level. Interactive /effort slider.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release-announcement\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Opus 4.7 feels more intelligent, agentic, and precise than 4.6\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w16\">Routines - Scheduled Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Templated cloud agents firing on schedule, GitHub events, or API calls.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor 3.1: Tiled Layout</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Split views into multiple panes for running multiple agents in parallel. Upgraded voice input.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights (23)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://x.com/karpathy/status/2015883857489522876\">Karpathy on Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"ite