ropic</a></div>\n                <div class=\"description\">Google is investing $10 billion in Anthropic initially, with potential for up to $30 billion more if performance targets are met. Amazon also committed additional funding.</div>\n                <div class=\"meta\">\n                    <span class=\"author\">Jay Peters</span> | <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2026/4/24/google-investing-billions-anthropic\">TechMedia</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tags\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">investments</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/news-insights/product-news/github-copilot-usage-based-billing/\">GitHub Copilot is moving to usage-based billing</a></div>\n                <div class=\"description\">GitHub announced changes to Copilot billing, moving toward usage-based pricing as agentic workflows consume significantly more compute resources than traditional coding assistance.</div>\n                <div class=\"meta\">\n                    <span class=\"author\">GitHub Blog</span> | <a href=\"https://github.blog/news-insights/product-news/github-copilot-usage-based-billing/\">HackerNews</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tags\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">GitHub</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">GitHub-Copilot</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">pricing</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40674123\">4TB of voice samples just stolen from 40k AI contractors at Mercor</a></div>\n                <div class=\"description\">A massive data breach involving 4TB of voice samples from 40,000 AI contractors at Mercor, raising serious concerns about AI training data security and contractor privacy.</div>\n                <div class=\"meta\">\n                    <span class=\"author\">Oravys</span> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40674123\">HackerNews</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tags\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">data-breach</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <a href=\"#\">Archive</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Contact</a>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">Generated with Claude Code</div>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
