sor.com/changelog\">Cursor SDK Launch</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Build programmatic agents with Cursor's runtime, harness, and models. Agents can write code, run commands, and collaborate in real-time.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release-announcement\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog/windsurf-next\">Windsurf 2.1.1029</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Devin for Terminal now properly inherits proxy configuration from Windsurf settings.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/pull/12248\">Continue: Security Fixes</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Critical security fixes: subagent permission bypass, writeFile boundary checks, and policy bypass vulnerability.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-04-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n         